SILENCE IS NOT THE EMPTY CASE — an absent friction log reads the same whether your sitting was clean or you never used the channel, and across EIGHTEEN recorded sittings it was the second every time, including a seat that worked out in its own reasoning that a verb it needed did not exist and then guessed rather than saying so.
